capri-shell is a fork of capri-desktop by mochiiwuff
(https://github.com/mochiiwuff/capri-desktop), MIT licensed, with changes
from the ZahinTapadar fork. The renderer (her sprite, acts, effects, panel,
window seating), the Win32 window watcher and the overlay host are theirs.

What this fork changes: the Ollama chat and the Claude Code hook bridge are
gone; her words, her voice and her cues come from Reze's brain (brain-bridge)
over its edge. See src/main/reze.js and src/renderer/js/link.js.

Capri, Project Capricorn and Cyberpunk: Edgerunners belong to CD PROJEKT RED,
Studio Trigger and Netflix. This is a fan project for one desk.
